# The VT suite's fixtures are byte-exact recordings of terminal streams: .in is the input
# and .golden the expected result. Both carry real CR LF pairs as data, so Git must never
# normalise their line endings. Doing so rewrites the recording, and the tests fail on the
# next checkout on someone else's machine rather than on the one that committed them.
*.golden -text
*.in -text

# The branding kit is pinned by SHA-256 in CHECKSUMS.sha256; any rewrite breaks the icons job.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
